2 CONT Gutkind Hirschel (1778–1862) moved from Germany to Copenhagen, Denmark, in 1801 and changed his name to Gerhard Bonnier (the name Bonnier is a French variant of the German given name Gutkind). In Copenhagen, Gerhard Bonnier starte
2 CONC d a library, a bookstore and also started a publishing company.
