2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Articles about him on English, Swedish, Danish and Dutch Wikipedia as of 2016.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_Marcus
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Marcus, also called R. Jakob, was a German-Swedish businessman and one of the pioneers in the history of Sweden's Jewish population, which began to take root around the turn of the 18th-19th centuries.
2 CONT
2 CONT Two of Marcus's daughters, Lowisa (1787-1842) and Hedda (1796-1834) married two brothers of the successful von Reis family of Gothenburg Jews
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT kom till Stockholm 1779 som betjänt hos Gumpert Hirsch;  
2 CONT tillstånd handel nipper Karlskrona 7.1.1782; skyddsbrev Norrköping 8.8.1782; 
2 CONT fick Marcusska gården i Norrköping i gåva av greve Axel Löwen; 
