2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ragnar_Josephson
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnar Josephson (Stockholm 8 March 1891 - Lund 27 March 1966) was a Swedish art historian and writer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josephson was professor of art history at Lund University 1929-1957 and founder of the Archive for Decorative Art there. He was director of the Royal Dramatic Theatre in Stockholm 1948-1951, and was elected a member of the Swedish
2 CONC  Academy in 1960.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ragnar_Josephson
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnar Josephson, född 8 mars 1891 i Stockholm, död 27 mars 1966 i Lund[1], var en svensk konsthistoriker, författare och chef för Kungliga Dramatiska teatern.
