1 OCCU 1756 hjemme, Business and EtatzRaad proprietaire
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the "etatsraad" (councillor?) and owner of Astrup in Salling.  He was reputed to be an enterprising and foresightful man, who managed a large house.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aksel Rosenkrantz de Lasson was married twice, and in between the two marriages had a son with a woman on Grinderslev Kloster.  The illegitimate son (Jens Tobias Peder Lassen) was not christened de Lasson but with the old surname,
2 CONC  Lassen.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BIRTH Parish Register, Bjørnsholm, Slet, Ålborg, Danmark, 1709-1782.
2 CONT
2 CONT “D. 4. februar blef velb. hr. Lassons søn christnet, nafnet: Axel Rosenkrands. Testes: Frue Bierregaard paa Øsle Closter, Frøkenen paa Vaar, General Stoffenberg, Velb, hr. Povelssøn paa Gunderupgaard, Juncher Biergaard af Øsle Clo
2 CONC ster.”
2 CONT
2 CONT !MARRIAGE Parish Register, Hersom, Rinds, Viborg, Danmark (Dansk Rigsarkiv, Arkivalieronline.dk)
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH Parish Register, Skive, Viborg, Danmark p 290 (Dansk Rigsarkiv, Arkivalieronline.dk)
