1 NAME Jacob /Conquy/
2 GIVN Jacob
2 _MARNM Conquy
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1740
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Gibraltar
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Conquy is listed on the 1777 Gibraltar Census as being 32 years old and absent. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The fact that he is listed as absent strengthens the theory that he is the father of Semaya
2 CONT  (Shemaiah) Conquy born 1776, probably in Marseille, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I also believe that this Jacob Conquy is the father of Isaac Conquy/ Conqui who married Sarah Tedeschi/ Tedesqui born 1778 on the Island of Corfu, Greece. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 21/10/1808 Sara Tedesqui Conqui is listed as living at Rue Vieille Cuiraterie n°11, Marseille, France with her children Judith, Simka, Jacob and Rose. Link: http://actes.geneprovence.com/acte_bans.php?xid=12151&xct=7830
2 CONT
2 CONT In the book "Genealogia Hebraica - Portugal e Gibraltar" By Jose Maria Abecasis, Abecasis lists the Conquy branch of Ponta Delgada as descending from a Jacob Conquy born circa 1740. Jacob's son Isaac is listed as marrying Sara Ted
2 CONC esqui listed above. This connects the Ponta Delgada branch back to the Marseille branch which can be linked back to the Gibraltar branch through Menahem Conquy. 
