2 CONT Testimony: http://db.yadvashem.org/names/nameDetails.html?itemId=9421367&language=en Dr. of law Felix Stein was born in Teplitz Schoenau, Czechoslovakia in 1866. He was a lawyer and single. Prior to WWII he lived in Teplitz Schoen
2 CONC au, Czechoslovakia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. of law Stein was murdered in the Shoah. 
