1 NAME Elias /Magnus/
2 GIVN Elias
2 SURN Magnus
2 _MARNM Magnus
2 NICK Elias Strelitz
2 NICK Elias Marstrand
2 NICK Elias Magnus
2 NICK Elias Magnusson
2 NICK Elias Segal
2 NICK Elias Emanuel
1 SEX M
