2 CONT Kilde: DIS: http://www.dis-danmark.dk/forum/read.php?1,645488,646736
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Rådmand i Nakskov '''Andreas Jensen Sønderup (Jens)''' was christened on 6 Jul 1749 in 
2 CONT  Vammen, Viborg. He died on 11 Jun 1821 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke, Nakskov. He was buried on 15 
2 CONT  Jun 1821 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke, Nakskov. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Andreas''' married Kirsten Clausdatter Lexau, daughter of Claus Nielsen Lexau and Maren  Nielsdatter Møller, on 21 Apr 1777 in Nakskov, Maribo Amt, Danmark.
2 CONT  Kirsten was christened in  Aug 1753 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke, Naskov. 
2 CONT She was buried on 30 Nov 1781 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke,  Nakskov. 
2 CONT  They had the following children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  8 M i. Claus Sønderup was christened on 23 Jun 1779 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke, Nakskov. 
2 CONT  Claus married Marie Joseppa Emilie Thone ?? on 20 Feb 1811 in Skt. Nikolaj,  Nakskov. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  + 9 M ii. Jens Sønderup was born on 26 Jul 1780.
2 CONT  He died on 15 Mar 1841. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 10 M iii. Niels Sønderup was christened on 7 Nov 1781 in Nakskov, Skt. Nicolaj Kirke,  Maribo Amt, Danmark. He was buried on 27 Feb 1782 in Nakskov Kirkes Nordre  Gang. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  '''Andreas''' also married Susanne Elisabeth Klink, daughter of Klink, before 1785. Susanne was  born about 1761. She died in efter 1801. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 F iv. Karen Kirstine Sønderup was born in Nakskov, Maribo Amt, Danmark.
2 CONT  She  was christened on 22 Jul 1785 in Skt. Nicolaj Kirke, Nakskov.
2 CONT  She died after  1850
2 CONT
