1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Children with Chayim: 
2 CONT * Anna, married Hein Goldschmidt (distant relative), died 1742 
2 CONT * Samuel. died 1763
2 CONT * Israel
2 CONT * Judith, married Carl Gottlieb Neumann
2 CONT * Freude, died 3 December 1734 in Copenhagen, was married to Aron Bendix Goldschmidt (distant relative), who died 26. jan. 1741 (or 1742?) in Copenhagen.
2 CONT * Roschen "Regine", died 19 April 1784 in Copenhagen; married after her sister Freude's death to the above mentioned Aron Bendix Goldgift; married 2nd time 15 January 1743 (or 1744?) to Abraham ("KiK" ?) Lazarus
2 CONT * Beile, died 18. aug. 1774 in Copenhagen, married to Behrendt Moses Rottenberg from Altona, merchant in Hamburg and later in Copenhagen, who died 21 July 1775 in Copenhagen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: another source ("Forgotten Fragments of the History of an Old Jewish Family", Copenhagen, 1975) lists her death as "approx. 1747".
