2 CONC 1699 Sekltnt., 1700 Prltnt., P. A. (30 October) Captain. in Holstein. Drag. Reg, with that of Saxony, 1701 Captain. in Rodsteens Drag. Reg in imperial Sold in Italy and Hungary, 1704 Sek.maj., Excelled in the affair by Thorda 1706
2 CONC  (May 29) and Luzzara, 1707 Obltnt. in Rytterreg. (Trappaud, v. Dehn, v. Dewitz) in imperial Sold in Hungary, in autumn 1709 with Reg home to Denmark, 1,710 (8 Sept.) Vessels. Colonel, took part in the Battle of Gadebusch, 1712 co
2 CONC mpanies. Colonel and Head 2 Fyn night. Rytterreg., Dep. The 1715th    Family Tree Finn Josef Skeel Holbek.
