2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mette Rosenørn''' was born on July 8, 1754 in Ulriksholm, Kolstrup, Odense, Danmark and was baptized on July 11, 1754 in Kølstrup Kirke, Kølstrup, Denmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836549 Peder Rosenørn]
2 CONC  and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836776 Ulrica Hedevig von Heinen, 4]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette married [https://www.geni.com/profile-74778520 Engel Carl Ernst von Schack] on December 6, 1776 in kiel, Schl. Holst., Tyskland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836833 Friedrich von Schack]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-114296563 Friedrich Ferdinand von Schack]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-114297594 Ernst Peter von Schack]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836767 Juliane Marie von Schack (Schack)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-66859747 Christian Julius Schack]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 25, 1811 in Güstrow, Mecklenburg-West Pommerania, Germany. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Mette Pauline von Schack''' née  Rosenørn
2 CONT
