1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Katholm Gods: https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katholm
2 CONT
2 CONT *
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Poul Pedersen Rosenørn''' was born on March 30, 1756 in Katholm. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836549 Peder Rosenørn] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836776 Ulrica Hedevig von Heinen, 4]. He was a chamber
2 CONC lain in 1778 , deputy in the West Indies-Guinea Treasury and General Customs Chamber 1781 , diocese of Fyens Diocese and county governor of Odense , Dalum , Sankt Knuds and Rugård Amter . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Poul Pedersen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-114298672 Cecilie Andrea Krabbe] on April 20, 1781. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836771 Cecilius Andreas Ulrik Andreas Rosenørn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 28, 1829 in Kølstrup, Region of Southern Denmark, Denmark. 
2 CONT ----
